{
  "_comment": "本机 start_vllm_4x_1.sh 起的 4 个 vLLM 实例，TP=2 各占两张卡。model 必须等于脚本里的 --served-model-name，api_key 等于 --api-key，concurrency 对齐 --max-num-seqs 64（客户端线程数超过它只会在服务端排队）。改脚本里的 SERVED_NAME / API_KEY / MAX_SEQS，这里要跟着改。",
  "request_timeout": 300,
  "max_retries": 2,
  "disable_backend_after_failures": 20,
  "backends": [
    {
      "name": "vllm-8001",
      "_gpu": "GPU 0,1",
      "api_base": "http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions",
      "model": "Qwen3.6-27B",
      "api_key": "local-pool-key",
      "concurrency": 64,
      "weight": 1,
      "extra_body": {
        "chat_template_kwargs": {
          "enable_thinking": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "vllm-8002",
      "_gpu": "GPU 2,3",
